{
  "$Comment": [
    "A spawnable example that walks the whole framework with no boss and no player: stand it up with",
    "/zigencounter spawn Zc_Encounter_Example and watch the [encounter] lines in the server log. It",
    "sends zc:engaged, a zc:wave beat, a zc:phase beat and zc:defeated, uses five of the six zc",
    "instruction Types once, then re-arms with zc:reset a few seconds later and runs again until it",
    "is ended. Its binding row is Server/ZiggfreedCommon/Encounters/Zc_Encounter_Example.json, so it",
    "also shows what a row pays.",
    "",
    "The Player sensor with the EncounterMembers collector sits first and never blocks the story:",
    "a player who walks up counts as a member and earns presence credit, and with nobody near the",
    "story runs on regardless. The Types used here, each legal only inside an encounter script:",
    "ZigScaleTarget applies the binding row's health scale to the bound subject now (here there is",
    "none, and it says so); ZigMembers is true while the member count is inside a range; ZigFeedback",
    "draws a FeedbackMoment for each member; ZigFactor is true while a factor reading about the fight",
    "is inside a range; ZigGrant pays every credited participant a loot reference, scaled by their",
    "share. The sixth, ZigRested, gates a summon on the binding row's Timing.Rest and belongs to a",
    "site with a spawn marker, which this example has none of; Zc_Encounter_Base shows it in place.",
    "",
    "A real boss takes the shape of Zc_Encounter_Base instead: TriggerSpawners raising the boss into",
    "a target slot, the release on the Target sensor, phases through Zc_Phase_At_Health, the defeat",
    "through Zc_Defeat_Beat. This file skips all of that on purpose, so it runs on a headless server",
    "with nobody online."
  ],
  "Class": "EncounterManager",
  "Type": "Generic",
  "StartState": "Intro",
  "Instructions": [
    {
      "Continue": true,
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "Player",
        "Range": 30,
        "Collector": {
          "Type": "EncounterMembers"
        }
      },
      "Actions": [
        {
          "Type": "Nothing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Intro"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Any"
          },
          "ActionsBlocking": true,
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Log",
              "Message": "[Zc_Encounter_Example] the story begins"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:engaged"
            },
            {
              "Type": "ZigScaleTarget"
            },
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 2, 2 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "State",
              "State": "Phase_1"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Phase_1"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "ZigMembers",
            "Count": [ 0, 0 ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Nothing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Any"
          },
          "ActionsBlocking": true,
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:wave:first"
            },
            {
              "Type": "ZigFeedback",
              "Moment": "Encounter_Phase_Changed",
              "ToMembers": true,
              "Args": {
                "phase": "Phase_2"
              }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 2, 2 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:phase:Phase_2"
            },
            {
              "Type": "State",
              "State": "Phase_2"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Phase_2"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "ZigFactor",
            "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves",
            "Value": [ 1, 1000000 ]
          },
          "ActionsBlocking": true,
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 2, 2 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "ClearEncounterBossBar"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:defeated"
            },
            {
              "Type": "ZigGrant",
              "ToMembers": true,
              "Loot": {
                "Rolls": [
                  {
                    "Grants": {
                      "Items": [
                        {
                          "Item": "Ingredient_Bar_Copper",
                          "Count": 2
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "Type": "State",
              "State": "Complete"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Complete"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Any"
          },
          "ActionsBlocking": true,
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 4, 4 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:reset"
            },
            {
              "Type": "State",
              "State": "Intro"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
